<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">3 YOANI</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yoa</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yoani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Yenetatu ya Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt1">3 Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Yenetatu ya Yoani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya 3 Yoani yaandikilwe na Ntumilwe Yoani kawegelya munsimu wa mwaka 90 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Yoani abayali panga ywembe nga mwandiki, lakini paali pake iaikema nng'oi (1:1). Apanga nyinyonyo mu 2 Yoani (1:1). Iu'bi'li'ka panga Yoani aandike Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Yoani na balua itatu yani 1 Yoani, 2 Yoani na 3 Yoani nsimu waabile katama mumuyi wa ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoani aandike balua yi' kwa muumini ywaakemilwe Gayo. Antambwi Gayo kati mbwigalye na ngammakia abe ntu'lya kwa alongo Akilisitu babaabile mumwanja pi'tya lwingo lwo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yoani aitapya balua yake <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:1">1:1</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Anyi'ya mwoyo Gayo na kumwawanikia alaye tu'ya kwa alongo aumini <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:2-8">1:2-8</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Aalongelya bandu bi'ngi' abi'li', Diotrefe na Demetrio <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:9-12">1:9-12</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ayomolya balua yake <char style="ior">(<ref loc="3JN 1:13-14">1:13-14</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Nenga na mpi'ndo wa kanisa, nikuandikya wenga wa Gayo, wambwiga lyangu' wanikupendile muno.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Wampendwa wangu', nilu'ba uyaliwe mumakowe goti na ube wankoti kati loo yako mwaiyaliwa. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Naatipulaika muno bi'ngi' ba alongo pabaaisile na kutuyaulya bu'kana no u'bi'li'ka kwako muukakape na mu'lu' mwoyendelya tama muukakape wo. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Ntu'pu' pulaa yaibile ngu'lu' pi'ta yi'no, yo yu'wa panga bana bangu' balo kabayendelya tama muukweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">U'bi'li'ka kwa Gayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Mpendwa wangu', wenga wamwu'bi'li'ka kwa galu' gawaapangya aumini, pamope no panga bembe ageni. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Aumini bo baalikong'ondeli kanisa lya pano abali ya upendo wako. Tukulu'ba uyendeli kwayangatia mumwanja wabe kwa ndi'la yainnogelelya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Kwa mwanjaa baayabwi mwanja wabe wa kuntumikia Kilisitu pangali pokya kili'be sosoti bu'ka kwa bandu bangau'bi'lya. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Kwa nyo, twenga tupalikwa kwayangatia bandu ba, li'nga tupate panga kasi pamope kwa ndi'la ya kweli.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diotrefe na Demetrio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Naandike balua nyipi kwa kanisa lyo, lakini Diotrefe ywapenda ba kolongosi wabe, akani kutuyu'wa. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Kwa nyo panaalu'a isa kwo, naalu'a kugaumukwa makowe goti gapanga, na ubu'su' waupiya bu'kana na twenga kwa makowe malau. Kai' ago baili, ila ywembe mwene aakemyali aumini bo, na ata balu' babapala kwakemya, endakwakanikia na kwabi'nga mukanisa.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Wampendwa wangu', kaneuyige lyalibile lyakau, ila uyige linogau. Ywembe ywapanga manogau ywa Nnu'ngu', lakini ywapanga maakau, antangiteli Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Kila mundu agalumba manogau bu'kana na Demetrio, na maisa gake galandana na kweli. Na twenga kai' twendakong'ondelya manogau bu'kana na ywembe, na wenga utangite panga satulongela sa kakape.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Nibile nago gambone ga kukuandikya, lakini nipendili kugaandika kwa bwino. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Lakini nipi'kanilya kukutyangilya masu'ba gaganogano ga papipi, na twenga twalu'a longela katulolana.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Amani ibe pamope na we. Mambwigalyo bababile pano bendakusalimia. Waasalimie mambwiga bitu bababile kwo, kila mundu kwa lina lyake.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>